MIT is compatible with LGPL-3.0. This repository contains no copy of that software
and uses it only through imports.

TypeScript and `@types/node` are development-only dependencies. TypeScript is
licensed under Apache-2.0 and is required only to build the committed JavaScript
artifacts. `@types/node` is licensed under MIT and supplies type declarations for the
Node.js API used during that build. Neither package is distributed as part of the
